{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../base/", "title": "Core"}, "next": {"link": "../web/", "title": "Web Interface"}, "title": "CLI", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"cli\">\n<h1>CLI<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#cli\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Command line interface (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">pyorchestrate</span></code>). The narrative pages under the CLI\ntab describe the commands from the user\u2019s point of view; this section covers\nthe classes that implement them, for anyone driving the CLI from Python.</p>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.cli\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-cli\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.cli<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.cli\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIConstants\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.cli.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CLIConstants</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIConstants\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Constants used throughout the CLI application.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIConstants.VERSION\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">VERSION</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'0.2.0'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIConstants.VERSION\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Alias of <code class=\"xref py py-data docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.__version__</span></code>, which reads the distribution\nmetadata: the version is declared only in <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">pyproject.toml</span></code>. Kept as an\nattribute so existing readers of <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CLIConstants.VERSION</span></code> keep working.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIConstants.DEFAULT_ZMQ_ADDRESS\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_ZMQ_ADDRESS</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'tcp://127.0.0.1:5555'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIConstants.DEFAULT_ZMQ_ADDRESS\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIConstants.DEFAULT_STATS_INTERVAL\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_STATS_INTERVAL</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">2.0</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIConstants.DEFAULT_STATS_INTERVAL\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.cli.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CommandClient</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">zmq_address</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'tcp://127.0.0.1:5555'</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Handles communication with the orchestrator via MessageChannel.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>zmq_address</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient.send_command\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">send_command</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">command</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">args</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient.send_command\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Send a command to the orchestrator and return the response.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>command</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>args</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.List\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>List</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>] </em><em>| </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Dict</em></a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">str</a>, <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Any\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Any</em></a>] | None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.cli.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseCommand</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">client</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">formatter</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/abc.html#abc.ABC\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ABC</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Abstract base class for all CLI commands.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>client</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\"><em>CommandClient</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>formatter</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\"><em>OutputFormatter</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand.execute\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execute</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">args</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand.execute\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Execute the command with the given arguments.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>args</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/argparse.html#argparse.Namespace\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Namespace</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.ProjectCommand\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.cli.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ProjectCommand</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">client</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">formatter</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.ProjectCommand\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseCommand</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Handles project creation commands.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>client</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\"><em>CommandClient</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>formatter</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\"><em>OutputFormatter</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.ProjectCommand.execute\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execute</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">args</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.ProjectCommand.execute\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Create a new project structure.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>args</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/argparse.html#argparse.Namespace\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Namespace</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.OrchestratorCommand\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.cli.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorCommand</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">client</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">formatter</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.OrchestratorCommand\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseCommand</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Handles orchestrator management commands.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>client</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\"><em>CommandClient</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>formatter</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\"><em>OutputFormatter</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.OrchestratorCommand.execute\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execute</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">args</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.OrchestratorCommand.execute\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Execute orchestrator command.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>args</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/argparse.html#argparse.Namespace\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Namespace</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.StatsCommand\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.cli.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">StatsCommand</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">client</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">formatter</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">interval</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">2.0</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.StatsCommand\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.BaseCommand\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseCommand</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Handles real-time stats monitoring.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>client</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\"><em>CommandClient</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>formatter</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\"><em>OutputFormatter</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>interval</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.StatsCommand.execute\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execute</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">args</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.StatsCommand.execute\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Display real-time stats of all agents.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>args</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/argparse.html#argparse.Namespace\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Namespace</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandRouter\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.cli.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CommandRouter</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">client</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">formatter</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandRouter\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Routes commands to appropriate command handlers.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>client</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandClient\"><em>CommandClient</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>formatter</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.OutputFormatter\"><em>OutputFormatter</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandRouter.route_command\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">route_command</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">args</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CommandRouter.route_command\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Route the command to the appropriate handler.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>args</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/argparse.html#argparse.Namespace\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Namespace</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.ArgumentParser\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.cli.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ArgumentParser</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.ArgumentParser\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Handles CLI argument parsing.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.ArgumentParser.create_parser\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">create_parser</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.ArgumentParser.create_parser\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Create and configure the argument parser.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/argparse.html#argparse.ArgumentParser\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>ArgumentParser</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.ArgumentParser.prepare_command_from_args\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">prepare_command_from_args</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">args</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.ArgumentParser.prepare_command_from_args\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Prepare command list from parsed arguments.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>args</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/argparse.html#argparse.Namespace\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Namespace</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIApplication\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.cli.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CLIApplication</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.cli.CLIApplication\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>M